{20}{OH! Did you know him? Well, I don't know how to say this really... You'll find "him" out to the west a little. [She hesistates] His tombstone is the cross. Poor kid.}{OH! Did you know him? Well, I don't know how to say this really... You'll find "him" out to the west a little. [She hesistates] His tombstone is the cross. Poor kid.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Tombstone? What?}{}{1}{}{23}{}
{22}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{23}{[She looks rather distressed.] you see, it happened not long after the demons were driven out of town. Joe caught a terrible fever. He was very brave about it... Muttered a lot about adventures and the like. He wasn't the only one either. But still, he was the youngest. When he... when he passed away, the town, and even the mage, Darren, all gathered. His family moved out, and I moved in. That's all really. I'm sorry.}{[She looks rather distressed.] you see, it happened not long after the demons were driven out of town. Joe caught a terrible fever. He was very brave about it... Muttered a lot about adventures and the like. He wasn't the only one either. But still, he was the youngest. When he... when he passed away, the town, and even the mage, Darren, all gathered. His family moved out, and I moved in. That's all really. I'm sorry.}{}{}{}{}
{24}{I see. I'll go visit him then. Thanks for the information.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
